 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (sections carry no counts): the Starting section (Death Star, Twi'lek Advisor, Security Precautions) counts toward the deck, with 2 more Twi'lek Advisor under Interrupts (3 in all).",
  "No Objective: the starting location Death Star is starting.card. The strategy names Battle Order (vs Operatives) and Come Here You Big Coward (vs Mind What You Have Learned) as other possible starting Effects.",
  "Posted 'AAA' (an Effect) dested Ability, Ability, Ability (judgment call: the only Dark Effect matching the initials and the note 'great to play ... when you dominate table'); 'Omni Box' Ommni Box; 'Cor Imp Square' Coruscant: Imperial Square; 'D War Room' Death Star: War Room; 'Dag Cave' Dagobah: Cave; 'Executor Med Chamber' Executor: Meditation Chamber.",
  "Posted 'EPP Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'EPP Fett' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'EJP Dengar' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'ECC Iggy' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'ECC 4-LOM' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'DVDLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'GMT' Grand Moff Tarkin; 'ZiMH' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'BiHT' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'CHYBC' Come Here You Big Coward; 'Hell To Pay' There'll Be Hell To Pay.",
  "Posted 'IAO (No escape for LS)' dested Imperial Arrest Order (the draft had dropped this line).",
  "Secret Plans, Oppressive Enforcement and Come Here You Big Coward are the Special Edition Effects (not Reflections III Defensive Shields)."
